---
description: Write few, fast, necessary tests. If a test needs more than 5s, rewrite it.
alwaysApply: true
---

# Tests must be necessary and fast

- Cover the behaviour the ticket promised. Do not add extra cases, snapshots, or a second test that fills the same form.
- Fill text with `fillField()` from the web `test-utils`. Do not `user.type` long strings.
- Query the exact field. `getByLabelText(/name/i)` also matches Full name. Use `getByRole("textbox", { name: /^name/i })`.
- Set Select values with `initialValues`. Do not open a Mantine dropdown in a form submit test. A picker component can click the dropdown once.
- Keep the default 5s Jest timeout. Do not raise it. If a test cannot finish in 5s on a laptop, it is not a good test.
